[{"score":1.1894577,"show":{"id":25948,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/25948/the-gifted","name":"The Gifted","type":"Scripted","language":"English","genres":["Drama","Adventure","Science-Fiction"],"status":"Ended","runtime":60,"averageRuntime":60,"premiered":"2017-10-02","ended":"2019-02-26","officialSite":"http://www.fox.com/the-gifted","schedule":{"time":"21:00","days":["Tuesday"]},"rating":{"average":7.4},"weight":97,"network":{"id":4,"name":"FOX","country":{"name":"United States","code":"US","timezone":"America/New_York"},"officialSite":"https://www.fox.com/"},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":328552,"imdb":"tt4396630"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/165/414995.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/165/414995.jpg"},"summary":"<p><b>The Gifted</b> tells the story of a suburban couple whose ordinary lives are rocked by the sudden discovery that their children possess mutant powers. Forced to go on the run from a hostile government, the family joins up with an underground network of mutants and must fight to survive.</p>","updated":1793615639,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/25948"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1589089","name":"oMens"}}}},{"score":1.1581692,"show":{"id":35760,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/35760/the-gifted","name":"The Gifted","type":"Scripted","language":"English","genres":["Drama","Comedy","Science-Fiction"],"status":"Ended","runtime":8,"averageRuntime":8,"premiered":"2014-04-24","ended":"2014-10-07","officialSite":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vmZR_ij9g-o&index=1&list=PL6MABftlVfnY141X8lKt8VvfoGSIjF9ys","schedule":{"time":"","days":["Tuesday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":53,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":21,"name":"YouTube","country":null,"officialSite":"https://www.youtube.com"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":"tt3691598"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/151/378458.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/151/378458.jpg"},"summary":"<p>In less than 20 years the world we know will no longer exist. But there is a hope. A small one. A women who grow up in Portadown, and her partner travel back from the future and put the fate of the world in the hands of a group of teenagers from different walks of life. They will be The Gifted. Does this heroine from the future really think the fate of human kind can be saved by a group of teenagers?! From Portadown?! Mayhem or madness. But who are the gifted?</p>","updated":1655022138,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/35760"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1438239","name":"Love Is a Battlefield"}}}},{"score":1.1487868,"show":{"id":39022,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/39022/the-gifted","name":"The Gifted","type":"Scripted","language":"Thai","genres":["Drama","Mystery","Supernatural"],"status":"Ended","runtime":60,"averageRuntime":55,"premiered":"2018-08-05","ended":"2020-11-29","officialSite":"https://www.gmm-tv.com/contents/episode/L68vZ/?v=zXM9V","schedule":{"time":"20:30","days":["Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":7.9},"weight":46,"network":{"id":1095,"name":"GMM25","country":{"name":"Thailand","code":"TH","timezone":"Asia/Bangkok"},"officialSite":"https://www.gmm25.com/"},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":350952,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/268/672009.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/268/672009.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Ritdha High School, the school that not only has gifted students but also the \"Gifted Program,\" a gifted class with only a handful of \"special\" students were chosen to study in this program. Unfortunately \"Pang\" a 10th-grade student from lowest class suddenly passed the Gifted placement test for unknown reason. His entrance to the Gifted Program was filled with confusion. He and his new friends in the class started to feel that there is something strange about this class. Eventually, they figure out that this Gifted Program is unleashing something about their \"potential\" in themselves to be awaken. Their lives are about to change, when great power that fulfill all their dreams come with troubles. Their gift is about to reveal a secret that this school tries to hide.</p>","updated":1776599096,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/39022"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1931174","name":"This Time Is Ours"}}}},{"score":0.86849535,"show":{"id":70439,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/70439/the-gifted-housekeeper","name":"The Gifted Housekeeper","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Ended","runtime":45,"averageRuntime":45,"premiered":"2023-08-05","ended":"2023-08-27","officialSite":null,"schedule":{"time":"19:30","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":8,"network":{"id":302,"name":"Dragon TV","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/471/1179802.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/471/1179802.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Lin Xiao Pan's parents divorced when she was a child, and after that, she went to Japan with her father to study, and graduated from Japan Junior College majoring in home economics. She seems to be silly and sweet, but in reality it's opposite- she's a stubborn and enthusiastic girl with a sense of justice. Her father dotes on his daughter and runs a Chinese restaurant in Japan.</p><p>Xiao Pan wanted to marry her boyfriend Zhou Zhi Wei, regardless of his father's opposition and his poor social background. But she didn't expect that he will run off, hearing about it. Wanting to start anew, Xiao Pan comes to Shanghai, and accidentally took over the job of cleaning the building, which starts her career as a housekeeper. Soon , she meets Zuo Fei, grieving lost of his wife, and they both starts to being closer.</p>","updated":1693073497,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/70439"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/2616797","name":"Episode 39"}}}},{"score":0.83460194,"show":{"id":91733,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/91733/the-gifted-detective","name":"The Gifted Detective","type":"Scripted","language":"Thai","genres":[],"status":"Ended","runtime":45,"averageRuntime":45,"premiered":"2020-01-06","ended":"2020-02-12","officialSite":null,"schedule":{"time":"19:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":2,"network":{"id":718,"name":"Channel 3","country":{"name":"Thailand","code":"TH","timezone":"Asia/Bangkok"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/624/1560075.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/624/1560075.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Son is a young detective that was born with a gift to see spirits. He often uses his gift to solve case. One day, Son uses his gift in the middle of the market and is sent to see a psychiatrist. The moment he meets Rung, they immediately dislike one another. Son is able to pass all mental evaluations, but because of her own prejudice, Rung reports that he is not ready for a mental evaluation.</p>","updated":1777970861,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91733"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3610394","name":"Episode 28"}}}},{"score":0.4719212,"show":{"id":23790,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/23790/the-gift","name":"The Gift","type":"Documentary","language":"English","genres":[],"status":"Ended","runtime":30,"averageRuntime":30,"premiered":"2015-02-10","ended":"2015-03-03","officialSite":"http://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/b052sqj7","schedule":{"time":"21:00","days":["Tuesday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":68,"network":{"id":12,"name":"BBC One","country":{"name":"United Kingdom","code":"GB","timezone":"Europe/London"},"officialSite":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bbcone"},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":291908,"imdb":"tt4448734"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/89/224365.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/89/224365.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Presenters Matt Baker and Mel Giedroyc follow the extraordinary and heart-warming stories of people who missed the chance to say 'thank you' or 'sorry' when it mattered most.</p>","updated":1609454196,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/23790"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1018960","name":"Episode 4"}}}},{"score":0.46289104,"show":{"id":34685,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/34685/the-gilded-age","name":"The Gilded Age","type":"Scripted","language":"English","genres":["Drama","History"],"status":"Running","runtime":60,"averageRuntime":60,"premiered":"2022-01-24","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://www.hbo.com/the-gilded-age","schedule":{"time":"21:00","days":["Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":7.6},"weight":100,"network":{"id":8,"name":"HBO","country":{"name":"United States","code":"US","timezone":"America/New_York"},"officialSite":"https://www.hbo.com/"},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":364412,"imdb":"tt4406178"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/648/1622443.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/648/1622443.jpg"},"summary":"<p>The American Gilded Age was a period of immense economic change, of huge fortunes made and lost, and the rise of disparity between old money and new.</p><p>Against this backdrop of change, the story begins in 1882 — introducing young Marian Brook, the orphaned daughter of a Union general, who moves into the New York City home of her thoroughly old money aunts Agnes van Rhijn and Ada Brook. Accompanied by Peggy Scott, an accomplished African-American woman, Marian inadvertently becomes enmeshed in a social war between one of her aunts, a scion of the old money set, and her stupendously rich neighbors, a ruthless railroad tycoon and his ambitious wife, George and Bertha Russell.</p><p>In this exciting new world that is on the brink of the modern age, will Marian follow the established rules of society, or forge her own path?</p>","updated":1795403229,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/34685"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3808839","name":"Good Taste"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3808840","name":"Dinner Is Served"}}}},{"score":0.44357434,"show":{"id":20988,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/20988/the-lifted-life","name":"The Lifted Life","type":"Reality","language":"English","genres":[],"status":"Ended","runtime":60,"averageRuntime":60,"premiered":"2016-04-09","ended":"2016-10-01","officialSite":"http://www.velocity.com/tv-shows/lifted-life/","schedule":{"time":"10:00","days":["Saturday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":42,"network":{"id":142,"name":"MotorTrend","country":{"name":"United States","code":"US","timezone":"America/New_York"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":388245,"imdb":"tt5951544"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/74/185197.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/74/185197.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Watch the team at Five R Trucks in Golden, CO. build insane trucks from rendering to reality.</p>","updated":1609693911,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/20988"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/939822","name":"Big Trucks for Big Truck Guys"}}}},{"score":0.40590912,"show":{"id":89035,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/89035/the-gift","name":"The Gift","type":"Scripted","language":"Tagalog","genres":[],"status":"Ended","runtime":30,"averageRuntime":null,"premiered":null,"ended":null,"officialSite":null,"schedule":{"time":"","days":[]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":23,"network":{"id":994,"name":"GMA","country":{"name":"Philippines","code":"PH","timezone":"Asia/Manila"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":433737,"imdb":"tt10956962"},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/603/1509079.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/603/1509079.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Joseph, a vendor in Divisoria uses his charm and enthusiasm to get through the hard days. Together with his adoptive family Strawberry and Char, he continues to find happiness despite the challenges in life. One day, he gets in a near-death accident leading him to lose his eyesight and gain the ability of clairvoyance.</p>","updated":1766060077,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/89035"}}}},{"score":0.3802998,"show":{"id":72801,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/72801/the-gift","name":"The Gift","type":"Scripted","language":"English","genres":["Family","Fantasy","Horror"],"status":"Ended","runtime":30,"averageRuntime":30,"premiered":"1990-03-28","ended":"1990-05-02","officialSite":null,"schedule":{"time":"","days":[]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":15,"network":{"id":12,"name":"BBC One","country":{"name":"United Kingdom","code":"GB","timezone":"Europe/London"},"officialSite":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/bbcone"},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":229251,"imdb":"tt0398476"},"image":null,"summary":"<p>After surviving an accident in his ancestral home in North Wales, Davy Price starts receiving disturbing visions: glimpses of other peoples' thoughts. His father's desperate plans to save his family are worrying enough, but the thoughts of a mysterious bystander, Wolf, are downright terrifying.</p>","updated":1700419887,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/72801"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/2690876","name":"Full Circle"}}}}]